  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring and Evaluation capacity building in South Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s development objective is to improve monitoring and evaluation frameworks, capacity, and use in supported developing countries in&#x202f;South Asia and Indonesia. In doing so, the project will seek to build partnerships with existing ECD providers to generate synergies.&#x202f;&#x202f; This project aims to contribute to the higher-level development of the objective of the GEI, namely, to improve monitoring and evaluation frameworks, capacity, and use in supported developing countries for improved evidence-informed policymaking.</narrative>
  </description>
